## Purpose

Delivered the owner's October11 explicitly requested PUBLIC prerelease using the approved existing
publishing helper. It includes Previous answer and the clean committed reference editions,
with the live website/full tutorial/eight demos as companion documentation.
This is a new version, not replacement of Preview1 assets or promotion to qualified v1.

## Ownership and order

- Documentation preparation owns README, authored guides/annotations, TODO/index/ledger/JOURNAL
  and complete generated atlas/handbook editions. No native source, media or UI rerender.
- Parent owns packaging, exact packaged-app tests, Git/publication, site source/test and installer
  version fields. Build the installer from clean committed source AFTER the complete PDFs are ready:
  scripts\Build-Installer.ps1:48-54 embeds the handbook in the payload.
- Final publication evidence is a separate follow-up after parent supplies exact receipts.
  No package build, test pass, asset hash, tag or publication is inferred from this preparation.
- Publication completed at2026-10-11T01:19:15Z. The authoritative public receipt is
  docs\release-0.2.0-preview.2.json; parent owns that receipt and the published assets.
  This maintained-documentation follow-up does not replace the tagged-build PDFs or package.

